553
00:46:58,861 --> 00:47:00,279
<i>E suave misericórdia</i>

554
00:47:00,696 --> 00:47:02,656
<i>"Deus e pecadores reconciliados"</i>

555
00:47:02,739 --> 00:47:06,201
